sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sender
    participant R as Receiver
    S->R: solid open
    S-->R: dotted open
    S->>R: solid arrow
    S-->>R: dotted arrow
    S<<->>R: solid both ways
    S<<-->>R: dotted both ways
    S-xR: solid cross
    S--xR: dotted cross
    S-)R: solid async
    S--)R: dotted async
    R->>S: solid arrow back
    R--xS: dotted cross back
